<title>SINGAPORE: Ossia gets new distribution rights.</title>
<headline>Ossia gets new distribution rights.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore sporting goods and apparel dealer Ossia International Ltd said it had won exclusive distributorship rights for the American Florsheim brand in Singapore, Malaysia and Brunei.</p>
<p>The agreement, which is valid for over five years, was signed with Florsheim Pacific Ltd, a company statement said.</p>
<p>Ossia also said it had won exclusive distributorship rights for Prince products in China recently via its subsidiary, Pacific Leisure (China) Ltd.</p>
<p>The company said its Australian subsidiary, Pacific Leisure (Australia) Pty Ltd, had been appointed exclusive distributor of Japan's Mizuno general sports equipment in Australia.</p>
<p>The four-year agreement allows Pacific Leisure (Australia) to make and sell apparel and sports bags in Australia under license to Misuno Corporation.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
